@startuml tf_correlation_analysis
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam activityDiamondBackgroundColor white
skinparam activityBackgroundColor white
skinparam activityBorderColor black
skinparam activityDiamondBorderColor black

title App Characteristic - Configuration Correlation Analysis

start

:Extract app characteristics from static analysis;
note right
  - UI complexity
  - Network usage
  - Encryption usage
  - View hierarchy depth
  - Database usage
  - etc.
end note

:Analyze test performance metrics across configurations;
note right
  - Coverage metrics
  - Exploration metrics
  - Error detection rates
  - Execution efficiency
end note

:Calculate correlations between
app characteristics and configuration performance;

fork
  :Identify positive correlations;
  note right
    Which configurations work
    well with which app types
  end note
fork again
  :Identify negative correlations;
  note right
    Which configurations perform
    poorly with which app types
  end note
end fork

:Validate correlations with statistical significance tests;

:Generate configuration recommendations based on app characteristics;

:Create correlation visualizations;
note right
  - Correlation heatmaps
  - Recommendation tables
  - App clustering diagrams
end note

stop

@enduml